# agent007memory — the console in front of AgentMemory.
#
# Almost everything this stack displays comes from the agentmemory stack's .env,
# read as an interpolation source through `ts-envfiles`. Copy this file to .env
# only to override something for this machine; an empty .env is normal and
# `ts-stack bootstrap` creates one.
#
# Billing (optional, OpenAI only): configure-openai-billing.sh/.ps1 writes
# .billing.env and ts-stack picks it up automatically. It holds identifiers,
# mount paths and masked key fingerprints -- never a key.

# Uncomment to override what the console's LLM page names as the provider,
# independently of what agentmemory is actually configured with. Normally leave
# these to the agentmemory stack.
#LLM_PROVIDER_LABEL=
#LLM_ENDPOINT_LABEL=
